d:291:### Style Evaluator — Assignment 7\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/02_RAG_SCANNER_CONTEXT.md:319:## Artifact Promotion\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/02_RAG_SCANNER_CONTEXT.md:348:## Re-Decomposition\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/02_RAG_SCANNER_CONTEXT.md:360:## Token-Saving Goal\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/02_RAG_SCANNER_CONTEXT.md:372:## Completion Criteria\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/02_RAG_SCANNER_CONTEXT.md:385:## Next\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/02_RAG_SCANNER_CONTEXT.md:391:## Reconciliation Boundary\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/01_MILESTONE_TASK_GRAPH.md:1:# Context 1 — Persistent Work Artifacts + Dependency Graph\r\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/01_MILESTONE_TASK_GRAPH.md:3:## Status\r\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/01_MILESTONE_TASK_GRAPH.md:19:## Goal That Was Achieved\r\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/01_MILESTONE_TASK_GRAPH.md:37:## Bootstrap Provenance\r\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/01_MILESTONE_TASK_GRAPH.md:79:## Persistent Graph Produced\r\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/01_MILESTONE_TASK_GRAPH.md:118:## Stable IDs and Traceability\r\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/01_MILESTONE_TASK_GRAPH.md:130:## Work Kinds\r\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/01_MILESTONE_TASK_GRAPH.md:140:### `feature`\r\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/01_MILESTONE_TASK_GRAPH.md:146:### `artifact`\r\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/01_MILESTONE_TASK_GRAPH.md:152:### `implementation`\r\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/01_MILESTONE_TASK_GRAPH.md:156:## Execution Scope Semantics\r\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/01_MILESTONE_TASK_GRAPH.md:181:## Status Semantics\r\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/01_MILESTONE_TASK_GRAPH.md:196:## Reconciliation Boundary\r\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/01_MILESTONE_TASK_GRAPH.md:211:## Core Implementation\r\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/01_MILESTONE_TASK_GRAPH.md:230:## `taskcontrol`\r\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/01_MILESTONE_TASK_GRAPH.md:242:### `validate`\r\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/01_MILESTONE_TASK_GRAPH.md:264:### `ready`\r\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/01_MILESTONE_TASK_GRAPH.md:289:### `list`, `show`, and `graph`\r\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/01_MILESTONE_TASK_GRAPH.md:297:## Real First-Task Example\r\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/01_MILESTONE_TASK_GRAPH.md:312:## Resource-Conflict Semantics\r\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/01_MILESTONE_TASK_GRAPH.md:325:## Lessons Preserved from Milestone 1\r\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/01_MILESTONE_TASK_GRAPH.md:338:## Completion Criteria — Satisfied\r\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/01_MILESTONE_TASK_GRAPH.md:357:## Next\r\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/CURRENT_STATE.md:1:# CURRENT STATE — No Safe Circle AI Pipeline\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/CURRENT_STATE.md:7:## Current Phase\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/CURRENT_STATE.md:79:## Architecture Review Result\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/CURRENT_STATE.md:107:## Architecture Correction Phase 1 — COMPLETE\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/CURRENT_STATE.md:123:## Architecture Correction Phase 2 — COMPLETE\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/CURRENT_STATE.md:183:## Milestone 1 Bootstrap State Retained\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/CURRENT_STATE.md:213:## Production GDD RAG — CURRENT AND VALIDATED\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/CURRENT_STATE.md:237:### RAG authority boundary\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/CURRENT_STATE.md:251:## Architecture Correction Phase 3A — IMPLEMENTED AND TESTED\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/CURRENT_STATE.md:253:### Purpose\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/CURRENT_STATE.md:265:### New Phase 3A files\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/CURRENT_STATE.md:281:### Evidence record model\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/CURRENT_STATE.md:319:### Repository authority boundary\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/CURRENT_STATE.md:327:### Deterministic current-state checks\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/CURRENT_STATE.md:342:### Derived states\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/CURRENT_STATE.md:359:### First real production conformance proof\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/CURRENT_STATE.md:401:### Phase 3A regression status\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/CURRENT_STATE.md:422:## Provider-Neutral Execution Crew Preparatory Stage 1 — COMPLETE\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/CURRENT_STATE.md:460:## Provider-Neutral Execution Crew Stage 3 — COMPLETE\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/CURRENT_STATE.md:484:### Stage 3 contract boundary\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/CURRENT_STATE.md:497:### Stage 3 runtime safety\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/CURRENT_STATE.md:517:### Stage 3 regression status\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/CURRENT_STATE.md:534:## Current Dispatch Policy\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/CURRENT_STATE.md:575:## Source-of-Truth Boundaries\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/CURRENT_STATE.md:577:### Game-design canon\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/CURRENT_STATE.md:581:### Production GDD retrieval\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/CURRENT_STATE.md:585:### Task contracts\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/CURRENT_STATE.md:591:### Integrated implementation\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/CURRENT_STATE.md:597:### Delivery/revalidation records\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/CURRENT_STATE.md:603:### Current conformance\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/CURRENT_STATE.md:611:### AgentRuntime requests/results\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/CURRENT_STATE.md:619:### Reconciliation\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/CURRENT_STATE.md:625:### Architecture review evidence\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/CURRENT_STATE.md:629:## Immediate Next Goal\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/CURRENT_STATE.md:631:### Migrate ArchitectureReview through generic AgentRuntime using Claude\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/CURRENT_STATE.md:665:## Real Gameplay Task Selection After the Evidence Proof\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/CURRENT_STATE.md:688:## Deferred Until Evidence Justifies It\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/CURRENT_STATE.md:708:## Obsolete Branch/Plan Warning\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/CURRENT_STATE.md:716:## Next Window Instructions\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
