graph_delta_json\": str(\r\nPipeline/Reconciliation/reconciliation_agent.py:1973:        \"proposed_graph_delta_markdown\": str(\r\nPipeline/Reconciliation/reconciliation_agent.py:2284:        \"belong in the persistent `Tasks/*.yaml` graph, not back in this \"\r\nPipeline/Reconciliation/reconciliation_agent.py:2369:    print(\"The reconciliation snapshot did NOT mutate Tasks/*.yaml.\")\r\nPipeline/Reconciliation/reconciliation_agent.py:2407:        delta = build_proposed_graph_delta(\r\nPipeline/Reconciliation/reconciliation_agent.py:2418:            render_graph_delta_markdown(delta),\r\nPipeline/Reconciliation/resume_parallel_refinement.py:12:    build_proposed_graph_delta,\r\nPipeline/Reconciliation/resume_parallel_refinement.py:13:    render_graph_delta_markdown,\r\nPipeline/Reconciliation/resume_parallel_refinement.py:180:        refined_graph_delta = build_proposed_graph_delta(\r\nPipeline/Reconciliation/resume_parallel_refinement.py:185:        refined_graph_delta[\"verification_run_id\"] = args.verification_run_id\r\nPipeline/Reconciliation/resume_parallel_refinement.py:186:        refined_graph_delta[\"source_reconciliation_run_id\"] = args.source_run_id\r\nPipeline/Reconciliation/resume_parallel_refinement.py:187:        base.save_new_json(paths[\"refined_delta_json\"], refined_graph_delta)\r\nPipeline/Reconciliation/resume_parallel_refinement.py:190:            render_graph_delta_markdown(refined_graph_delta),\r\nPipeline/Reconciliation/resume_parallel_refinement.py:327:        print(\"Tasks/*.yaml was not modified.\")\r\nPipeline/Reconciliation/recover_verification.py:13:    build_proposed_graph_delta,\nPipeline/Reconciliation/recover_verification.py:14:    render_graph_delta_markdown,\nPipeline/Reconciliation/recover_verification.py:216:        refined_delta = build_proposed_graph_delta(\nPipeline/Reconciliation/recover_verification.py:229:                render_graph_delta_markdown(refined_delta),\nPipeline/Reconciliation/recover_verification.py:320:        print(\"Tasks/*.yaml was not modified.\")\nPipeline/Reconciliation/parallel_reconciliation_agent.py:1315:        delta = base.build_proposed_graph_delta(\r\nPipeline/Reconciliation/parallel_reconciliation_agent.py:1326:            base.render_graph_delta_markdown(delta),\r\nPipeline/Reconciliation/prompts/reconcile.md:11:You do not create `Tasks/*.yaml`.\r\nPipeline/Reconciliation/prompts/reconcile.md:23:The result must be truthful enough that a later deterministic Work Graph Seeder can create `Tasks/*.yaml` after human approval.\r\nPipeline/Reconciliation/outputs/LATEST.json:8:  \"proposed_graph_delta_json\": \"Pipeline/Reconciliation/outputs/runs/20260821T193541Z-998ee7b5/PROPOSED_GRAPH_DELTA.json\",\r\nPipeline/Reconciliation/outputs/LATEST.json:9:  \"proposed_graph_delta_markdown\": \"Pipeline/Reconciliation/outputs/runs/20260821T193541Z-998ee7b5/PROPOSED_GRAPH_DELTA.md\"\r\nPipeline/Reconciliation/prompts/verification/refiner.md:10:You do not create `Tasks/*.yaml`.\r\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/ADR-032_TASK_CONTRACT_SCHEMA_V2.md:7:Migrate `Tasks/*.yaml` from schema 1.0 to task-contract schema 2.0.\r\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/START_HERE.md:40:AgentRuntime exposes generic `AgentInvocationRequest` with no dependency on NSC task IDs or `Tasks/*.yaml`; TaskExecution separately owns NSC task identity. ArchitectureReview now reaches Codex through `AgentRunner` without TaskExecution. ExecutionCrew, Reconciliation migration, provider fallback, and write/command authority remain out of scope.\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/START_HERE.md:50:- Reconciliation/verification history is immutable; `Tasks/*.yaml` is the living operational work graph.\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/START_HERE.md:186:A later reconciliation creates a new snapshot and may propose a graph delta. That delta must cross an explicit review/diff/apply boundary before changing persistent work.\nPipeline/Reconciliation/outputs/current/STATUS.md:11:- **Persistent `Tasks/*.yaml` mutated:** `false`\r\nPipeline/Reconciliation/outputs/current/VERIFICATION.md:3:> Independent model-diverse audit of a reconciliation snapshot. Verification never mutates `Tasks/*.yaml`.\r\nPipeline/Reconciliation/outputs/current/PROPOSED_GRAPH_DELTA.md:3:> This is a proposal generated from an immutable reconciliation snapshot. It does not modify `Tasks/*.yaml`.\r\nPipeline/Reconciliation/outputs/current/PROPOSED_GRAPH_DELTA.md:11:No persistent Tasks/*.yaml graph exists yet. This snapshot proposes bootstrap seed records only; human approval and the deterministic Work Graph Seeder are required before any persistent task state is created.\r\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/ADR-031_TASK_STATUS_ADVISORY.md:7:The existing `status: open|complete` field in `Tasks/*.yaml` is retained temporarily as legacy human-planning metadata, but it is not execution authority and does not prove current completion.\r\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/00_MASTER_CONTEXT.md:314:A later reconciliation may propose additions/changes/conflicts against the persistent graph, but the Reconciliation Agent does not directly rewrite `Tasks/*.yaml`.\r\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/00_MASTER_CONTEXT.md:316:Future graph changes must cross an explicit deterministic diff/review/apply boundary.\r\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/06_PROVIDER_NEUTRAL_EXECUTION_CREW_PLAN.md:253:- mutate `Tasks/*.yaml`;\r\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/01_MILESTONE_TASK_GRAPH.md:58:Persistent Tasks/*.yaml\r\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/01_MILESTONE_TASK_GRAPH.md:207:The living operational state is `Tasks/*.yaml`.\r\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/01_MILESTONE_TASK_GRAPH.md:209:Future graph changes must cross an explicit deterministic diff/review/apply boundary. Safe cascading readiness changes are computed from the graph, not written by an LLM.\r\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/01_MILESTONE_TASK_GRAPH.md:352:- reconciliation history is immutable and cannot directly rewrite `Tasks/*.yaml`;\r\nPipeline/Reconciliation/outputs/current/PROPOSED_GRAPH_DELTA.json:8:  \"summary\": \"No persistent Tasks/*.yaml graph exists yet. This snapshot proposes bootstrap seed records only; human approval and the deterministic Work Graph Seeder are required before any persistent task state is created.\",\r\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/DECISIONS.md:217:## ADR-026 — Reconciliation proposes graph deltas but never directly mutates the persistent graph\r\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/DECISIONS.md:219:**Decision:** Reconciliation output is compared against `Tasks/*.yaml` through a deterministic diff/review/apply boundary. The Reconciliation Agent may propose new, changed, conflicting, or stale work records, but it does not rewrite the persistent graph itself.\r\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/DECISIONS.md:223:**Bootstrap clarification:** Before `Tasks/*.yaml` exists, reconciliation emits proposed seed records. Human approval plus the deterministic Work Graph Seeder turns those records into the initial graph.\r\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/DECISIONS.md:292:**Decision:** `AgentRuntime` owns one generic bounded provider invocation through `AgentInvocationRequest`; it does not know NSC task IDs, task-contract identity, or `Tasks/*.yaml`. `Pipeline/TaskExecution` owns `TaskExecutionRequest` and delegates the exact contained invocation downward while retaining a separate immutable task audit artifact.\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/ADR-039_AGENT_RUNTIME_TASK_EXECUTION_SEPARATION.md:15:AgentRuntime owns generic bounded invocation only. Its immutable `AgentInvocationRequest` contains `schema_version`, `run_id`, `role`, `prompt`, `context_paths`, `allowed_capabilities`, `write_boundaries`, `output_schema`, `model_capability_class`, `budgets`, and `provider_configuration_key`. AgentRuntime owns provider selection, invocation, structured output, normalized failures, usage, logs, and immutable generic artifacts. It has no knowledge of NSC task naming or `Tasks/*.yaml`.\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/CURRENT_STATE.md:143:Tasks/*.yaml = approved definition of work\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/CURRENT_STATE.md:149:Tasks/*.yaml = definition + running state + validation state + completion truth\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/CURRENT_STATE.md:587:`Tasks/*.yaml` defines approved work identity, scope, dependencies, acceptance criteria, completion gates, downstream obligations, exclusive resources, contract revision/disposition, and provenance.\nPipeline/Reconciliation/outputs/current/CANDIDATE.md:1634:Treat this file as an immutable point-in-time reconciliation snapshot. Do not edit it to reflect later implementation progress. Review the accompanying `PROPOSED_GRAPH_DELTA.md`; approved changes belong in the persistent `Tasks/*.yaml` graph, not back in this snapshot.\r\nPipeline/Reconciliation/outputs/runs/20260821T193541Z-998ee7b5/PROPOSED_GRAPH_DELTA.md:3:> This is a proposal generated from an immutable reconciliation snapshot. It does not modify `Tasks/*.yaml`.\r\nPipeline/Reconciliation/outputs/runs/20260821T193541Z-998ee7b5/PROPOSED_GRAPH_DELTA.md:11:No persistent Tasks/*.yaml graph exists yet. This snapshot proposes bootstrap seed records only; human approval and the deterministic Work Graph Seeder are required before any persistent task state is created.\r\nPipeline/Reconciliation/outputs/runs/20260821T193541Z-998ee7b5/PROPOSED_GRAPH_DELTA.json:8:  \"summary\": \"No persistent Tasks/*.yaml graph exists yet. This snapshot proposes bootstrap seed records only; human approval and the deterministic Work Graph Seeder are required before any persistent task state is created.\",\r\nPipeline/Reconciliation/outputs/runs/20260821T193541Z-998ee7b5/RECONCILIATION.md:1587:Treat this file as an immutable point-in-time reconciliation snapshot. Do not edit it to reflect later implementation progress. Review the accompanying `PROPOSED_GRAPH_DELTA.md`; approved changes belong in the persistent `Tasks/*.yaml` graph, not back in this snapshot.\r\nPipeline/Reconciliation/outputs/runs/20260821T193541Z-998ee7b5/verifications/20260821T195959Z-43dba5de/PROPOSED_REFINED_GRAPH_DELTA.md:3:> This is a proposal generated from an immutable reconciliation snapshot. It does not modify `Tasks/*.yaml`.\r\nPipeline/Reconciliation/outputs/runs/20260821T193541Z-998ee7b5/verifications/20260821T195959Z-43dba5de/PROPOSED_REFINED_GRAPH_DELTA.md:11:No persistent Tasks/*.yaml graph exists yet. This snapshot proposes bootstrap seed records only; human approval and the deterministic Work Graph Seeder are required before any persistent task state is created.\r\nPipeline/Reconciliation/outputs/runs/20260821T193541Z-998ee7b5/verifications/20260821T195959Z-43dba5de/REFINED_RECONCILIATION.md:1634:Treat this file as an immutable point-in-time reconciliation snapshot. Do not edit it to reflect later implementation progress. Review the accompanying `PROPOSED_GRAPH_DELTA.md`; approved changes belong in the persistent `Tasks/*.yaml` graph, not back in this snapshot.\r\nPipeline/Reconciliation/outputs/runs/20260821T193541Z-998ee7b5/verifications/20260821T195959Z-43dba5de/PROPOSED_REFINED_GRAPH_DELTA.json:8:  \"summary\": \"No persistent Tasks/*.yaml graph exists yet. This snapshot proposes bootstrap seed records only; human approval and the deterministic Work Graph Seeder are required before any persistent task state is created.\",\r\nPipeline/Reconciliation/outputs/runs/20260821T193541Z-998ee7b5/verifications/20260821T195959Z-43dba5de/VERIFICATION.md:3:> Independent model-diverse audit of a reconciliation snapshot. Verification never mutates `Tasks/*.yaml`.\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
